# Frontend quality gates

When changing anything under `ui/`:

```bash
cd ui && npm run qualityCheck
```

This runs **Biome**, **`tsc`**, **Vitest**, **production build**, **Playwright**, and **`npm audit --audit-level=high`**.

The git **pre-commit** hook runs the same when staged files include `ui/`.

Do **not** weaken rules, skip Playwright, or use `--no-verify`. Prefer hermetic Vitest/Playwright fakes over full Compose for the gate. See `docs/frontend-quality.md`.
